    {
      "sourceRecordId": "tooltip",
      "termEn": "Tooltip",
      "sourceDefinition": "| UI Library | Can be nested? | Closes other tooltips? | Note | | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | | Ant Design | No | Yes (default, but can be changed) | Only accepts textual content | | Atlaskit | No | Yes | Only accepts textual content | | Bootstrap | No | Yes, but stays open when clicked | Only accepts textual content | | Carbon design system | No | Yes | Only accepts textual content | | Evergreen | No | Yes | Only accepts textual content | | UI Fabrik | No | Yes | Linked example could potentially be nested, but not intentional | | FAST | Yes | Yes (but not when nested, previous stays open) | In the sandbox (link on library) nesting was possible to achieve | | KoliBri | To be investigated | To be investigated | | | Lightning Design System | To be investigated | To be investigated | | | Material Components Web | To be investigated | Yes | It can contain custom HTML, further investigation necessary for nesting | | Semantic UI | No | Not the parent when nested | Linked example could potentially be nested, but not intentional | | Stardust UI | No | can be prevented | Only in other elements, but not nested in tooltip (according to documentation) | | Boosted | No | Not when other tooltip is clicked | Only accepts textual content |",
      "sourceCategory": "component-research",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/openui/open-ui/blob/93671dc549f262b1a33e7c221caddfcd75e8f126/site/src/pages/components/tooltip.research.mdx",
